From: Evolution BR811 <344454957+Evolution-BR811@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:59:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] VGM/NSF import: fewer instruments, more of the music in the
 pattern

- pitch steps inside a note become legato notes (EA01 + note, with its
  own E5xx) instead of an arpeggio macro in a new instrument
- chord arpeggios (note, +x, +y per tick) become 00xy in the pattern,
  with legato notes where the root moves (arp phase resets per note)
- a final pass over the whole song: an instrument that is only a cut
  short or quieter copy of another one is dropped, its notes use the
  other one with their own volume column (exact, in any order)
- the loop row sets volume, fine tune, arpeggio and legato again when
  the end of the song leaves them different

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KMJUrc1fn7dir5w2PfSPK2
